blocks.en:
We evaluate four settings on 20 scenes:
(1) w/o Grid Search , using direct 3D coordinate prediction;
(2) w/o Anchoring , reverting to Infinigen’s grounding;
(3) w/o Semantic Target , removing semantic surface constraints;
and (4) Agent (Placement) , allowing a VLM agent to autonomously place our generated 3D assets in the same selected coarse scene given the text prompt, without our placement pipeline.

blocks.zh:
我们评价20场景的四个设置:
(1) 网格搜索,使用直接的3D坐标预测;
(2) w/o 安乔林,回到Infinigen的地基;
(3) 语义目标,去除语义表面束缚;
和 (4) Agent (Placement),允许VLM Agent将我们生成的3D资产自动放置在同一个选定的粗糙场景中,因为文字迅速,没有我们的放置管道.

blocks.en:
We provide additional implementation details for the six
ablation settings:
(1) w/o Ref. Image removes the reference image
from the generation pipeline;
(2) Random Factory replaces factory retrieval
with random selection;
(3) w/o Planner removes structured planning
and replaces the Editing Plan with empty content;
(4) Agent (Infinigen) gives a Claude Opus 4.8
coding-agent harness access to the entire Infinigen
codebase and Bash tools, allowing autonomous code
generation, rendering, and refinement without SCE
constraints, for up to six rounds;
(5) w/o Refiner removes fine-level refinement;
and (6) 3 Rounds limits the refinement budget
to three rounds, compared with six in the full method.

blocks.zh:
我们为这六个项目提供更多的执行细节。
终止设置 :
(1) 参考文献。 图像删除参考图像
从一代的管道;
(2) 随机工厂取代工厂回收
随机选择;
(3) 规划员取消结构化规划
并用空内容取代编辑计划;
(4)代理(Infinigen)给克洛德·奥普斯4.8
连接整个 Infinigen 的编码代理工具
代码库和 Bash 工具,允许自动代码
生成、渲染和完善,无 SCE
不超过六轮的限制;
(5) W/o 炼油厂取消精细级的改进;
和(6). 3 回合限制完善预算
至三轮,而全方法为六轮。
